So, the first thing
that we can think of is

00:51:38.671 --> 00:51:42.805
whether truly blind
estimation room volume

00:51:42.806 --> 00:51:44.815
is necessarily the way to go.

00:51:44.816 --> 00:51:47.380
I think if you approach

00:51:47.381 --> 00:51:50.345
the problem from a device
specific perspective,

00:51:50.346 --> 00:51:52.230
you can come up with

00:51:52.231 --> 00:51:54.780
semi-blind approaches
and make assumptions

00:51:54.781 --> 00:51:59.360
on some of the room
environment and resources,

00:51:59.361 --> 00:52:00.810
by taking advantage of

00:52:00.811 --> 00:52:02.755
other sensors present
on your device.

00:52:02.756 --> 00:52:04.875
For example, you can use

00:52:04.876 --> 00:52:08.190
