to have a reference,

00:52:08.191 --> 00:52:09.440
so you can compare that reference

00:52:09.441 --> 00:52:11.365
to other incoming signals,

00:52:11.366 --> 00:52:13.170
make some type of

00:52:13.171 --> 00:52:16.755
multi-channel correlation
feature extraction,

00:52:16.756 --> 00:52:19.200
you could think about tracking

00:52:19.201 --> 00:52:21.060
moving sources and see
how the changes for

00:52:21.061 --> 00:52:27.575
space maybe by correlating
that with camera image.

00:52:27.576 --> 00:52:31.090
Some depth sensors
in devices can give

00:52:31.091 --> 00:52:33.040
you already some kind
of a local measure

00:52:33.041 --> 00:52:34.375
on what's around you.

00:52:34.376 --> 00:52:38.570
So, this is all food

00:52:38.571 --> 00:52:43.730
for thought for more precise
and tailored solutions.

00:52:43.810 --> 00:52:46.500
Data collection can be

00:52:46.501 --> 00:52:49.700
